# Keep the deployment exactly what it is today: a static site plus the one
# function in api/. None of the test tooling belongs in the build.
#
# package.json is excluded on purpose. Uploading it would make Vercel run an
# install step it has never needed — api/lead.js is deliberately
# dependency-free — and @playwright/test would pull a browser download into
# every deploy. Excluding it keeps Vercel detecting this as a static site,
# which is the behaviour the site already has in production.
package.json
package-lock.json
playwright.config.js

test/
e2e/
node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
coverage/

.github/
TESTING.md

# practice-lab/ is a product of negotiatorsondemand.com, staged here only
# because this session could not attach the NOD-ify repository it belongs to.
# Excluding it keeps a landing page for a different property off this domain.
# See practice-lab/README.md before moving it.
practice-lab/

# rocketman/ is a side project — a real-time strategy game — that has nothing
# to do with a negotiation consultancy. Excluding it keeps it off
# negotiatorcruz.com entirely. It is self-contained and moves to its own repo
# without changes; see rocketman/README.md.
rocketman/
